{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_01d36982","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"5:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"5136\">\n    <frame id=\"5:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"56\" y=\"56\" width=\"1288\" height=\"185\">\n      <text id=\"5:4\" name=\"NECTAR · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"5:5\" name=\"Nectar — online groceries app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1288\" height=\"60\" />\n      <text id=\"5:6\" name=\"Design the complete Nectar mobile grocery app: a shopper in Dhaka signs in with a phone number, browses the store, opens a product, explores a category, fills the cart, checks out, gets an order confirmation and manages the account. Canvas 414 × 896 (iPhone), light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"104\" width=\"1288\" height=\"81\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"56\" y=\"289\" width=\"1288\" height=\"268\">\n      <text id=\"5:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 12 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, rating), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use product photos, category images, the logo, flag, illustrations and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"216\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"56\" y=\"605\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2273\">\n      <text id=\"5:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2182\">\n        <frame id=\"5:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"225\">\n          <text id=\"5:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:18\" name=\"• Brand: Nectar logo\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"153\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:20\" name=\"→ auto → 02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"180\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:21\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:22\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:23\" name=\"Goal: Welcome a new shopper and get started.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:25\" name=\"• Actions: Get Started • Brand: Nectar_Carrot • Copy: “Welcome to our store” · “Get your groceries in as fast as one hour” • Media: Photo_Welcome_Delivery\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:27\" name=\"→ Get Started → 03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:28\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"0\" y=\"320\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:29\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:30\" name=\"Goal: Start sign-in with a phone number or a social account.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:32\" name=\"• Actions: Continue with Google · Continue with Facebook • Copy: “Get your groceries with nectar” · “Or connect with social media” • Media: Photo_Sign_In_Groceries • Phone: country code +880 (Flag_Bangladesh) · number not entered yet\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:34\" name=\"→ phone number → 04_Verification\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:35\" name=\"04_Verification\" x=\"660\" y=\"320\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:36\" name=\"04_Verification\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:37\" name=\"Goal: Verify the phone number with a 4-digit code.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:39\" name=\"• Actions: back · Resend Code · next • Code: “Code” · 4 digits, none entered yet • Copy: “Enter your 4-digit code”\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"5:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"195\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:41\" name=\"→ back → 03_Sign_In → next → 05_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"222\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:42\" name=\"05_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"640\" width=\"628\" height=\"435\">\n          <text id=\"5:43\" name=\"05_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:44\" name=\"Goal: Find groceries fast — by search, offer or category.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:46\" name=\"• Best Selling: “Best Selling” · See all · Bell Pepper Red, Ginger • Brand: Nectar_Carrot • Exclusive Offer: “Exclusive Offer” · See all · Organic Bananas, Red Apple • Groceries: “Groceries” · See all · categories Pulses, Rice · products Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken • Location: Dhaka, Banasree • Main navigation: current tab Shop • Products (all sections): each with image, name, unit, price and add to cart • Promotion: “Fresh Vegetables” · “Get Up To 40% OFF” (Banner_Fresh_Vegetables) • Search: “Search Store”\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"210\" />\n          <text id=\"5:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"342\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:48\" name=\"→ Red Apple → 06_Product_Detail → tabs → 05 / 07 / 09 / 12\" x=\"24\" y=\"369\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:49\" name=\"06_Product_Detail\" x=\"660\" y=\"640\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"5:50\" name=\"06_Product_Detail\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:51\" name=\"Goal: Judge a product and add it to the basket.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:53\" name=\"• Actions: back · share · favourite (not favourited yet) · Add To Basket • Details: “Product Detail” with its description (open) · “Nutritions” 100gr · “Review” 5 of 5 stars • Product: Product_Red_Apple · “Natural Red Apple” · “1kg, Price” · $4.99 • Quantity: 1, can be decreased / increased\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"5:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:55\" name=\"→ back → 05_Home → Add To Basket → 09_My_Cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:56\" name=\"07_Explore\" x=\"0\" y=\"1107\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"5:57\" name=\"07_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:58\" name=\"Goal: Browse the store by category.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:60\" name=\"• Categories: 6, each with its image — Fresh Fruits &amp; Vegetable · Cooking Oil &amp; Ghee · Meat &amp; Fish · Bakery &amp; Snacks · Dairy &amp; Eggs · Beverages • Copy: “Find Products” • Main navigation: current tab Explore • Search: “Search Store”\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"5:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:62\" name=\"→ Beverages → 08_Beverages → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:63\" name=\"08_Beverages\" x=\"660\" y=\"1107\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:64\" name=\"08_Beverages\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:65\" name=\"Goal: Pick drinks from one category.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:67\" name=\"• Actions: back · filter entry • Copy: “Beverages” • Products: 6 — Diet Coke · Sprite Can · Apple &amp; Grape Juice · Orange Juice · Coca Cola Can · Pepsi Can — each with image, name, size, price and add to cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:69\" name=\"→ back → 07_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:70\" name=\"09_My_Cart\" x=\"0\" y=\"1469\" width=\"628\" height=\"351\">\n          <text id=\"5:71\" name=\"09_My_Cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:72\" name=\"Goal: Review the basket and go to checkout.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:73\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:74\" name=\"• Actions: Go to Checkout, showing the cart total $14.96 • Cart: 4 items — Bell Pepper Red · Egg Chicken Red · Organic Bananas · Ginger — each with image, name, unit, price, quantity 1 (can be decreased / increased) and remove • Copy: “My Cart” • Main navigation: current tab Cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"5:75\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"258\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:76\" name=\"→ Go to Checkout → 10_Checkout_Overlay → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"285\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:77\" name=\"10_Checkout_Overlay\" x=\"660\" y=\"1469\" width=\"628\" height=\"372\">\n          <text id=\"5:78\" name=\"10_Checkout_Overlay\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:79\" name=\"Goal: Confirm delivery, payment and cost, then place the order.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:80\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:81\" name=\"• Actions: close · Place Order • Copy: “Checkout” • Legal: “By placing an order you agree to our Terms And Conditions” (Terms And Conditions is a link) • Order rows: Delivery “Select Method” · Payment (card, Icon_Payment) · Promo Code “Pick discount” · Total Cost $14.96 — each row opens its own choice • Presentation: opens over 09_My_Cart; the cart stays behind it\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n          <text id=\"5:82\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"279\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:83\" name=\"→ close → 09_My_Cart → Place Order → 11_Order_Accepted\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:84\" name=\"11_Order_Accepted\" x=\"0\" y=\"1873\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:85\" name=\"11_Order_Accepted\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:86\" name=\"Goal: Confirm the order unambiguously.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:87\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:88\" name=\"• Actions: Track Order · Back to home • Copy: “Your Order has been accepted” · “Your items have been placed and are on their way to being processed” • Media: Illustration_Order_Accepted\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:89\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:90\" name=\"→ Back to home → 05_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:91\" name=\"12_Account\" x=\"660\" y=\"1873\" width=\"628\" height=\"309\">\n          <text id=\"5:92\" name=\"12_Account\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:93\" name=\"Goal: Identify the account and reach account settings.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:94\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:95\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · “Afsar Hossen” · edit name entry · imshuvo97@gmail.com • Actions: Log Out • Entries: About · Delivery Address · Help · My Details · Notifications · Orders · Payment Methods · Promo Code • Main navigation: current tab Account\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"5:96\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:97\" name=\"→ tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:98\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"56\" y=\"2926\" width=\"1288\" height=\"244\">\n      <text id=\"5:99\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:100\" name=\"• Onboarding: 01_Splash → 02_Onboarding → 03_Sign_In → 04_Verification → 05_Home. • Main navigation on 05, 07, 09, 12 — five tabs in this order: Shop (Icon_Shop) → 05 · Explore (Icon_Explore) → 07 · Cart (Icon_Cart) → 09 · Favourite (Icon_Favourite, entry only) · Account (Icon_Account) → 12. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Pushed screens with back: 04, 06, 08. 06 and 08 have no main navigation. • 10_Checkout_Overlay opens over 09_My_Cart; 11_Order_Accepted replaces it. • Entry only (no screen required): See all, add to cart on product cards, share, favourite, filter, Resend Code, social sign-in, Track Order, Favourite tab, Delivery / Payment / Promo Code rows, account entries, edit name, Log Out. • There is no search-results, filter, favourites, location or order-failed screen — do not add frames beyond the 12.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"192\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:101\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"56\" y=\"3218\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1186\">\n      <text id=\"5:102\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:103\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:104\" name=\"Data cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1095\">\n        <frame id=\"5:105\" name=\"Shopper\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:106\" name=\"Shopper\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:107\" name=\"Afsar Hossen · imshuvo97@gmail.com · avatar = Avatar_Neutral Location: Dhaka, Banasree · phone country code +880 (Bangladesh) Currency USD · unit line format “1kg, Price”\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:108\" name=\"Catalog (name · unit · price · image)\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"227\">\n          <text id=\"5:109\" name=\"Catalog (name · unit · price · image)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:110\" name=\"Organic Bananas · 7pcs · $4.99 · Product_Organic_Bananas Red Apple · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Red_Apple (detail title “Natural Red Apple”) Bell Pepper Red · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Bell_Pepper_Red Ginger · 250gm · $2.99 · Product_Ginger Beef Bone · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Beef_Bone Broiler Chicken · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Broiler_Chicken Egg Chicken Red · 4pcs · $1.99 · Product_Egg_Chicken_Red\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:111\" name=\"Beverages (name · size · price)\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"628\" height=\"206\">\n          <text id=\"5:112\" name=\"Beverages (name · size · price)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:113\" name=\"Diet Coke · 355ml · $1.99 Sprite Can · 325ml · $1.50 Apple &amp; Grape Juice · 2L · $15.99 Orange Juice · 2L · $15.99 Coca Cola Can · 325ml · $4.99 Pepsi Can · 330ml · $4.99\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:114\" name=\"Home\" x=\"660\" y=\"259\" width=\"628\" height=\"206\">\n          <text id=\"5:115\" name=\"Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:116\" name=\"Location “Dhaka, Banasree” · search “Search Store” Promotion “Fresh Vegetables” · “Get Up To 40% OFF” Exclusive Offer: Organic Bananas, Red Apple Best Selling: Bell Pepper Red, Ginger Groceries: categories Pulses (Category_Pulses), Rice (Category_Rice); Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:117\" name=\"Product detail\" x=\"0\" y=\"497\" width=\"628\" height=\"164\">\n          <text id=\"5:118\" name=\"Product detail\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:119\" name=\"“Natural Red Apple” · “1kg, Price” · quantity 1 · $4.99 Product Detail: “Apples are nutritious. Apples may be good for weight loss. Apples may be good for your heart. As part of a healthful and varied diet.” Nutritions: 100gr · Review: 5 of 5 stars\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:120\" name=\"Cart &amp; checkout\" x=\"660\" y=\"497\" width=\"628\" height=\"164\">\n          <text id=\"5:121\" name=\"Cart &amp; checkout\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:122\" name=\"Bell Pepper Red $4.99 · Egg Chicken Red $1.99 · Organic Bananas $4.99 · Ginger $2.99 — quantity 1 each Total $14.96 — the same on Go to Checkout and Total Cost Delivery “Select Method” · Promo Code “Pick discount”\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:123\" name=\"Explore\" x=\"0\" y=\"693\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:124\" name=\"Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:125\" name=\"“Find Products” · search “Search Store” Fresh Fruits &amp; Vegetable · Cooking Oil &amp; Ghee · Meat &amp; Fish · Bakery &amp; Snacks · Dairy &amp; Eggs · Beverages (images: Category_*)\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:126\" name=\"Sign in, verification &amp; order\" x=\"660\" y=\"693\" width=\"628\" height=\"227\">\n          <text id=\"5:127\" name=\"Sign in, verification &amp; order\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:128\" name=\"Sign in: “Get your groceries with nectar” · +880 · “Or connect with social media” · Continue with Google · Continue with Facebook Verification: “Enter your 4-digit code” · “Code” · Resend Code Onboarding: “Welcome to our store” · “Get your groceries in as fast as one hour” · Get Started Accepted: “Your Order has been accepted” · “Your items have been placed and are on their way to being processed” · Track Order · Back to home\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:129\" name=\"Account\" x=\"0\" y=\"952\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:130\" name=\"Account\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:131\" name=\"Afsar Hossen · imshuvo97@gmail.com Orders · My Details · Delivery Address · Payment Methods · Promo Code · Notifications · Help · About · Log Out\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:132\" name=\"Source corrections\" x=\"660\" y=\"952\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:133\" name=\"Source corrections\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:134\" name=\"The source has typos (Naturel, Frash, Orenge, “Priceg”, “placcd”, Promo Cord, Notifecations), product prices that differ between screens and cart totals that do not add up ($12.96 / $13.97). Follow this brief, not the source.\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:135\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"56\" y=\"4452\" width=\"1288\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"5:136\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:137\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"5:138\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"5:139\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:140\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color + Poppins • Media: product photos, category images, logo, flag, illustrations, icons, neutral avatar • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:141\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"187\">\n          <text id=\"5:142\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:143\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and rating colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, favourite, quantity, open / closed • Headers, main navigation, overlay and all business components\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:144\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"56\" y=\"4781\" width=\"1288\" height=\"299\">\n      <text id=\"5:145\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:146\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"5:147\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tabs, quantities, favourite, empty code input, checkout over cart)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"168\" />\n      <text id=\"5:148\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 12 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"275\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06ae3923-d12a-4248-9468-ebfe96d71820","uuid":"7f4ccc07-dcad-4ac1-a0f5-b13f23a62aa5","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:41:09.707Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"5:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"5136\">\n    <frame id=\"5:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"56\" y=\"56\" width=\"1288\" height=\"185\">\n      <text id=\"5:4\" name=\"NECTAR · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"5:5\" name=\"Nectar — online groceries app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1288\" height=\"60\" />\n      <text id=\"5:6\" name=\"Design the complete Nectar mobile grocery app: a shopper in Dhaka signs in with a phone number, browses the store, opens a product, explores a category, fills the cart, checks out, gets an order confirmation and manages the account. Canvas 414 × 896 (iPhone), light mode only. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"104\" width=\"1288\" height=\"81\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"56\" y=\"289\" width=\"1288\" height=\"268\">\n      <text id=\"5:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 12 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / warning / disabled, rating), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use product photos, category images, the logo, flag, illustrations and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"216\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"56\" y=\"605\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2273\">\n      <text id=\"5:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2182\">\n        <frame id=\"5:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"225\">\n          <text id=\"5:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:18\" name=\"• Brand: Nectar logo\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"153\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:20\" name=\"→ auto → 02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"180\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:21\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:22\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:23\" name=\"Goal: Welcome a new shopper and get started.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:25\" name=\"• Actions: Get Started • Brand: Nectar_Carrot • Copy: “Welcome to our store” · “Get your groceries in as fast as one hour” • Media: Photo_Welcome_Delivery\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:27\" name=\"→ Get Started → 03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:28\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"0\" y=\"320\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:29\" name=\"03_Sign_In\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:30\" name=\"Goal: Start sign-in with a phone number or a social account.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:32\" name=\"• Actions: Continue with Google · Continue with Facebook • Copy: “Get your groceries with nectar” · “Or connect with social media” • Media: Photo_Sign_In_Groceries • Phone: country code +880 (Flag_Bangladesh) · number not entered yet\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:34\" name=\"→ phone number → 04_Verification\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:35\" name=\"04_Verification\" x=\"660\" y=\"320\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:36\" name=\"04_Verification\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:37\" name=\"Goal: Verify the phone number with a 4-digit code.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:39\" name=\"• Actions: back · Resend Code · next • Code: “Code” · 4 digits, none entered yet • Copy: “Enter your 4-digit code”\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"5:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"195\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:41\" name=\"→ back → 03_Sign_In → next → 05_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"222\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:42\" name=\"05_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"640\" width=\"628\" height=\"435\">\n          <text id=\"5:43\" name=\"05_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:44\" name=\"Goal: Find groceries fast — by search, offer or category.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:46\" name=\"• Best Selling: “Best Selling” · See all · Bell Pepper Red, Ginger • Brand: Nectar_Carrot • Exclusive Offer: “Exclusive Offer” · See all · Organic Bananas, Red Apple • Groceries: “Groceries” · See all · categories Pulses, Rice · products Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken • Location: Dhaka, Banasree • Main navigation: current tab Shop • Products (all sections): each with image, name, unit, price and add to cart • Promotion: “Fresh Vegetables” · “Get Up To 40% OFF” (Banner_Fresh_Vegetables) • Search: “Search Store”\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"210\" />\n          <text id=\"5:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"342\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:48\" name=\"→ Red Apple → 06_Product_Detail → tabs → 05 / 07 / 09 / 12\" x=\"24\" y=\"369\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:49\" name=\"06_Product_Detail\" x=\"660\" y=\"640\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"5:50\" name=\"06_Product_Detail\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:51\" name=\"Goal: Judge a product and add it to the basket.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:53\" name=\"• Actions: back · share · favourite (not favourited yet) · Add To Basket • Details: “Product Detail” with its description (open) · “Nutritions” 100gr · “Review” 5 of 5 stars • Product: Product_Red_Apple · “Natural Red Apple” · “1kg, Price” · $4.99 • Quantity: 1, can be decreased / increased\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"5:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:55\" name=\"→ back → 05_Home → Add To Basket → 09_My_Cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:56\" name=\"07_Explore\" x=\"0\" y=\"1107\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"5:57\" name=\"07_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:58\" name=\"Goal: Browse the store by category.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:60\" name=\"• Categories: 6, each with its image — Fresh Fruits &amp; Vegetable · Cooking Oil &amp; Ghee · Meat &amp; Fish · Bakery &amp; Snacks · Dairy &amp; Eggs · Beverages • Copy: “Find Products” • Main navigation: current tab Explore • Search: “Search Store”\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"5:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:62\" name=\"→ Beverages → 08_Beverages → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:63\" name=\"08_Beverages\" x=\"660\" y=\"1107\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:64\" name=\"08_Beverages\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:65\" name=\"Goal: Pick drinks from one category.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:67\" name=\"• Actions: back · filter entry • Copy: “Beverages” • Products: 6 — Diet Coke · Sprite Can · Apple &amp; Grape Juice · Orange Juice · Coca Cola Can · Pepsi Can — each with image, name, size, price and add to cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:69\" name=\"→ back → 07_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:70\" name=\"09_My_Cart\" x=\"0\" y=\"1469\" width=\"628\" height=\"351\">\n          <text id=\"5:71\" name=\"09_My_Cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:72\" name=\"Goal: Review the basket and go to checkout.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:73\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:74\" name=\"• Actions: Go to Checkout, showing the cart total $14.96 • Cart: 4 items — Bell Pepper Red · Egg Chicken Red · Organic Bananas · Ginger — each with image, name, unit, price, quantity 1 (can be decreased / increased) and remove • Copy: “My Cart” • Main navigation: current tab Cart\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n          <text id=\"5:75\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"258\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:76\" name=\"→ Go to Checkout → 10_Checkout_Overlay → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"285\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:77\" name=\"10_Checkout_Overlay\" x=\"660\" y=\"1469\" width=\"628\" height=\"372\">\n          <text id=\"5:78\" name=\"10_Checkout_Overlay\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:79\" name=\"Goal: Confirm delivery, payment and cost, then place the order.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:80\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:81\" name=\"• Actions: close · Place Order • Copy: “Checkout” • Legal: “By placing an order you agree to our Terms And Conditions” (Terms And Conditions is a link) • Order rows: Delivery “Select Method” · Payment (card, Icon_Payment) · Promo Code “Pick discount” · Total Cost $14.96 — each row opens its own choice • Presentation: opens over 09_My_Cart; the cart stays behind it\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n          <text id=\"5:82\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"279\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:83\" name=\"→ close → 09_My_Cart → Place Order → 11_Order_Accepted\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:84\" name=\"11_Order_Accepted\" x=\"0\" y=\"1873\" width=\"628\" height=\"288\">\n          <text id=\"5:85\" name=\"11_Order_Accepted\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:86\" name=\"Goal: Confirm the order unambiguously.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:87\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:88\" name=\"• Actions: Track Order · Back to home • Copy: “Your Order has been accepted” · “Your items have been placed and are on their way to being processed” • Media: Illustration_Order_Accepted\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n          <text id=\"5:89\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"216\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:90\" name=\"→ Back to home → 05_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"243\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:91\" name=\"12_Account\" x=\"660\" y=\"1873\" width=\"628\" height=\"309\">\n          <text id=\"5:92\" name=\"12_Account\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"5:93\" name=\"Goal: Identify the account and reach account settings.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"5:94\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:95\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · “Afsar Hossen” · edit name entry · imshuvo97@gmail.com • Actions: Log Out • Entries: About · Delivery Address · Help · My Details · Notifications · Orders · Payment Methods · Promo Code • Main navigation: current tab Account\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"5:96\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"5:97\" name=\"→ tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:98\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"56\" y=\"2926\" width=\"1288\" height=\"244\">\n      <text id=\"5:99\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:100\" name=\"• Onboarding: 01_Splash → 02_Onboarding → 03_Sign_In → 04_Verification → 05_Home. • Main navigation on 05, 07, 09, 12 — five tabs in this order: Shop (Icon_Shop) → 05 · Explore (Icon_Explore) → 07 · Cart (Icon_Cart) → 09 · Favourite (Icon_Favourite, entry only) · Account (Icon_Account) → 12. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Pushed screens with back: 04, 06, 08. 06 and 08 have no main navigation. • 10_Checkout_Overlay opens over 09_My_Cart; 11_Order_Accepted replaces it. • Entry only (no screen required): See all, add to cart on product cards, share, favourite, filter, Resend Code, social sign-in, Track Order, Favourite tab, Delivery / Payment / Promo Code rows, account entries, edit name, Log Out. • There is no search-results, filter, favourites, location or order-failed screen — do not add frames beyond the 12.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"192\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:101\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"56\" y=\"3218\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1186\">\n      <text id=\"5:102\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:103\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:104\" name=\"Data cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1095\">\n        <frame id=\"5:105\" name=\"Shopper\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:106\" name=\"Shopper\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:107\" name=\"Afsar Hossen · imshuvo97@gmail.com · avatar = Avatar_Neutral Location: Dhaka, Banasree · phone country code +880 (Bangladesh) Currency USD · unit line format “1kg, Price”\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:108\" name=\"Catalog (name · unit · price · image)\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"227\">\n          <text id=\"5:109\" name=\"Catalog (name · unit · price · image)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:110\" name=\"Organic Bananas · 7pcs · $4.99 · Product_Organic_Bananas Red Apple · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Red_Apple (detail title “Natural Red Apple”) Bell Pepper Red · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Bell_Pepper_Red Ginger · 250gm · $2.99 · Product_Ginger Beef Bone · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Beef_Bone Broiler Chicken · 1kg · $4.99 · Product_Broiler_Chicken Egg Chicken Red · 4pcs · $1.99 · Product_Egg_Chicken_Red\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:111\" name=\"Beverages (name · size · price)\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"628\" height=\"206\">\n          <text id=\"5:112\" name=\"Beverages (name · size · price)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:113\" name=\"Diet Coke · 355ml · $1.99 Sprite Can · 325ml · $1.50 Apple &amp; Grape Juice · 2L · $15.99 Orange Juice · 2L · $15.99 Coca Cola Can · 325ml · $4.99 Pepsi Can · 330ml · $4.99\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:114\" name=\"Home\" x=\"660\" y=\"259\" width=\"628\" height=\"206\">\n          <text id=\"5:115\" name=\"Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:116\" name=\"Location “Dhaka, Banasree” · search “Search Store” Promotion “Fresh Vegetables” · “Get Up To 40% OFF” Exclusive Offer: Organic Bananas, Red Apple Best Selling: Bell Pepper Red, Ginger Groceries: categories Pulses (Category_Pulses), Rice (Category_Rice); Beef Bone, Broiler Chicken\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:117\" name=\"Product detail\" x=\"0\" y=\"497\" width=\"628\" height=\"164\">\n          <text id=\"5:118\" name=\"Product detail\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:119\" name=\"“Natural Red Apple” · “1kg, Price” · quantity 1 · $4.99 Product Detail: “Apples are nutritious. Apples may be good for weight loss. Apples may be good for your heart. As part of a healthful and varied diet.” Nutritions: 100gr · Review: 5 of 5 stars\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:120\" name=\"Cart &amp; checkout\" x=\"660\" y=\"497\" width=\"628\" height=\"164\">\n          <text id=\"5:121\" name=\"Cart &amp; checkout\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:122\" name=\"Bell Pepper Red $4.99 · Egg Chicken Red $1.99 · Organic Bananas $4.99 · Ginger $2.99 — quantity 1 each Total $14.96 — the same on Go to Checkout and Total Cost Delivery “Select Method” · Promo Code “Pick discount”\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:123\" name=\"Explore\" x=\"0\" y=\"693\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:124\" name=\"Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:125\" name=\"“Find Products” · search “Search Store” Fresh Fruits &amp; Vegetable · Cooking Oil &amp; Ghee · Meat &amp; Fish · Bakery &amp; Snacks · Dairy &amp; Eggs · Beverages (images: Category_*)\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:126\" name=\"Sign in, verification &amp; order\" x=\"660\" y=\"693\" width=\"628\" height=\"227\">\n          <text id=\"5:127\" name=\"Sign in, verification &amp; order\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:128\" name=\"Sign in: “Get your groceries with nectar” · +880 · “Or connect with social media” · Continue with Google · Continue with Facebook Verification: “Enter your 4-digit code” · “Code” · Resend Code Onboarding: “Welcome to our store” · “Get your groceries in as fast as one hour” · Get Started Accepted: “Your Order has been accepted” · “Your items have been placed and are on their way to being processed” · Track Order · Back to home\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:129\" name=\"Account\" x=\"0\" y=\"952\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:130\" name=\"Account\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:131\" name=\"Afsar Hossen · imshuvo97@gmail.com Orders · My Details · Delivery Address · Payment Methods · Promo Code · Notifications · Help · About · Log Out\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:132\" name=\"Source corrections\" x=\"660\" y=\"952\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"5:133\" name=\"Source corrections\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:134\" name=\"The source has typos (Naturel, Frash, Orenge, “Priceg”, “placcd”, Promo Cord, Notifecations), product prices that differ between screens and cart totals that do not add up ($12.96 / $13.97). Follow this brief, not the source.\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:135\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"56\" y=\"4452\" width=\"1288\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"5:136\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"5:137\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"5:138\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"5:139\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:140\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color + Poppins • Media: product photos, category images, logo, flag, illustrations, icons, neutral avatar • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"5:141\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"187\">\n          <text id=\"5:142\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"5:143\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic and rating colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, favourite, quantity, open / closed • Headers, main navigation, overlay and all business components\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"5:144\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"56\" y=\"4781\" width=\"1288\" height=\"299\">\n      <text id=\"5:145\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"5:146\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"5:147\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tabs, quantities, favourite, empty code input, checkout over cart)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"168\" />\n      <text id=\"5:148\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 12 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"275\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"7661c792-ef50-4dd6-8392-6625af0d00e1"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_01d36982","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
