{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":32300,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02106ae57f860a7acd19646adb7427bc","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Account confirmed: zuohaosheng@tetras.ai. Now I have a clear picture:\n\n**Task**: Build Nectar grocery app — 12 frames (414×896, light mode):\n1. 01_Splash → auto → 02_Onboarding\n2. 02_Onboarding → Get Started → 03_Sign_In\n3. 03_Sign_In → phone number → 04_Verification\n4. 04_Verification → back → 03_Sign_In, next → 05_Home\n5. 05_Home → Red Apple → 06_Product_Detail, tabs\n6. 06_Product_Detail → back → 05_Home, Add To Basket → 09_My_Cart\n7. 07_Explore → Beverages → 08_Beverages, tabs\n8. 08_Beverages → back → 07_Explore\n9. 09_My_Cart → Go to Checkout → 10_Checkout_Overlay, tabs\n10. 10_Checkout_Overlay → close → 09_My_Cart, Place Order → 11_Order_Accepted\n11. 11_Order_Accepted → Back to home → 05_Home\n12. 12_Account → tabs\n\n**Fixed**: Brand primary #53B175, Poppins font, canvas 414×896.\n\nLet me check the Workspace page and inspect the existing components (Button, Text Field, Status Bar, Home Indicator) and Media assets to get their fills/images so I can reuse them.\n\nLet me first look at the workspace page (7:2) and take screenshots of key reference frames. I need to inspect the component structures via use_figma read-only to understand how to instantiate them (they're components in the same file, so I can create instances via figma.getNodeById + createInstance... Actually components on other pages — I can call createInstance() on them from plugin code and then move them to workspace page).\n\nAlso I need to check whether the media symbols are components (symbol = component). Yes, they're `<symbol>` elements meaning COMPONENT nodes. So I can instantiate them.\n\nPlan:\n1. Inspect workspace page 7:2.\n2. Use read-only use_figma to inspect details of components (Button 6:29, Text Field 6:35, Status Bar 6:43, Home Indicator 6:54) and check fonts/colors.\n3. Take screenshots of media library to see the assets visually.\n4. Build a design system in the workspace: colors, type scale.\n5. Create reusable components in the workspace page (or a components frame in workspace): Nav Bar, Product Card, Category Card, Search Bar, Quantity Stepper, Cart Row, etc.\n6. Build the 12 frames.\n7. Wire prototype interactions.\n8. Screenshot each screen, verify, fix.\n\nLet me start. First get metadata of workspace and screenshots of reference pages.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06ae3923-d12a-4248-9468-ebfe96d71820","uuid":"48e28a27-ea26-4047-a4ce-5fcd94c18622","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:41:40.534Z","thinking_duration_ms":11310}
