ogle_White / Icon_Facebook_White are white versions — perfect.\n\nCartRow component: 364x110: image 70x70 left, name, unit, price + stepper right + remove X. \n\nCheckoutRow component: label left grey, value right + chevron.\n\nAccountRow component: icon left, label, chevron right.\n\nSectionHeader component: title left SemiBold 24 + \"See all\" green right.\n\nLet me create batch 2 now: SocialButton/Google, SocialButton/Facebook, ProductCard, CategoryTile, CategoryChip, CartRow, CheckoutRow, AccountRow, NavTab, NavBar, SectionHeader.\n\nPositions in component zone: y from 160 onward, x grid. Zone width 800.\n\nLet me define helpers again (each use_figma call is separate scope, must redefine).\n\nMedia component IDs:\nProducts: Apple_Grape_Juice 4:22, Beef_Bone 4:25, Bell_Pepper_Red 4:28, Broiler_Chicken 4:31, Coca_Cola_Can 4:34, Diet_Coke 4:37, Egg_Chicken_Red 4:40, Ginger 4:43, Orange_Juice 4:46, Organic_Bananas 4:49, Pepsi_Can 4:52, Red_Apple 4:55, Sprite_Can 4:58\nCategories: Bakery_Snacks 4:64, Beverages 4:67, Cooking_Oil_Ghee 4:70, Dairy_Eggs 4:73, Fresh_Fruits_Vegetable 4:76, Meat_Fish 4:79, Pulses 4:82, Rice 4:85\nIcons: About 4:115, Account 4:118, Cart 4:121, Chevron_Right 4:124, Delivery_Address 4:127, Explore 4:130, Facebook_White 4:133, Favourite 4:136, Google_White 4:139, Help 4:142, My_Details 4:145, Notifications 4:148, Orders 4:151, Payment 4:154, Promo 4:157, Search 4:160, Shop 4:163\n\nFor ProductCard default instance: put Red Apple image. Instances swap via swapComponent.\n\nNote: components created with createComponent in a page — instancing via createInstance then placing into frames. Fine.\n\nProductCard structure with auto layout? Keep absolute for simplicity but consistent sizing.\n\nLet me write batch 2 code.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06ae3923-d12a-4248-9468-ebfe96d71820","uuid":"39545c80-03f1-4266-8723-04685960f7db","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:43:30.608Z","thinking_duration_ms":32240